 ### `GET /health`
 
 Returns 200 with `{"status": "ok"}`.
+
+### `GET /receipts/<id>`
+
+Needs a signed-in user. Returns the receipt (`id`, `customer_id`, `total_cents`) of that customer, or 404 with `{"error": "receipt not found"}`. A receipt of another customer is also a 404.
+
+### `GET /receipts?q=<text>`
+
+Needs a signed-in user. Returns `{"receipts": [{"id": 1, "memo": "...", "total_cents": 500}]}` with that customer's receipts whose memo contains the text. The characters `%` and `_` count as normal text. A missing or empty `q` is a 400 with `{"error": "q is required"}`, and a `q` of more than 100 characters is a 400 with `{"error": "q is too long"}`.
